cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CARMA: Cost-Aware Retrieval Memory Arbitration for Field Robots"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A layer around a vision-language-action navigation backbone that arbitrates
  between acting, retrieving from a memory of human corrections, and querying
  the operator, under a shared cost model in which operator attention is a
  measured resource.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - field robotics
  - vision-language-action
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - human-robot interaction
  - precision agriculture
authors:
  - given-names: Erick
    affiliation: "Óbuda University, Antal Bejczy Center for Intelligent Robotics"
